#: ../../../api/book_async.md:1
msgid "BookAsync"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../api/book_async.md:1
msgid "Type hint for the async API in xlwings Lite scripts."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../api/book_async.md:3
msgid ""
"Annotate a script's `book` parameter with `xw.BookAsync` to opt into the "
"async, on-demand API --- no cell values are pre-loaded, and you read them "
"via `await myrange.get_value()`:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../api/book_async.md:16
msgid ""
"At runtime it's a plain `Book`; the annotation only signals xlwings Lite to "
"skip loading the values of the entire book up front."
msgstr ""
